{"id":"n89918-2-8","stage":2,"title":"없이 · 没有","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89918-2-8-1","ko":"오늘은 좀 한가하네요.","zh":"今天好像有点空闲呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한가하네요.","meaning":"闲适，空闲","explanation":"한가하다：闲适，空闲；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"한가하다","audio":"/audio/2279ff72ddecb20f150a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84082","senseId":"1","lemma":"한가하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"2279ff72ddecb20f","term":"한가하다","zh":"闲适，空闲","audio":"/audio/2279ff72ddecb20f150a.mp3","entryId":"84082","definition":"不忙，有余暇。","pronunciation":["한가하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/baf97a88925da11b2fc3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89918-2-8-2","ko":"네, 드나드는 손님도 없이 가게 안이 조용해요.","zh":"是啊，店里没有进出的客人，非常安静。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드나드는","meaning":"进进出出","explanation":"드나들다：进进出出；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"드나들다","audio":"/audio/d6ccf43e4e75aebfbfb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50930","senseId":"1","lemma":"드나들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님도","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없이","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없이：没有","readings":[{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89918","senseId":"2","lemma":"없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가게","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안이","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조용해요.","meaning":"安静","explanation":"조용하다：安静；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"조용하다","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58167","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"d6ccf43e4e75aebf","term":"드나들다","zh":"进进出出","audio":"/audio/d6ccf43e4e75aebfbfb6.mp3","entryId":"50930","definition":"许多人或事物进出某处。","pronunciation":["드나들다"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"c4b723256abd5d51","term":"없이","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3","entryId":"89918","definition":"某物不多的状态。","pronunciation":["업ː씨"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"1cd9dc985df28c49","term":"조용하다","zh":"安静","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3","entryId":"58167","definition":"听不见任何声音。","pronunciation":["조용하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/97fae5d6d420572e1621.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89918","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":62,"sequenceScore":1.4202,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，店里没有进出的客人，非常安静。","今天好像有点空闲呢。","你的爱好是什么？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天好像有点空闲呢。","你的爱好是什么？","是啊，店里没有进出的客人，非常安静。"],"answer":2}]}
